description:
Acidtrip recaps the grim reality of 2020 with Willie Contraband as they perform a mind-opening, ingenious, and eccentric single from the upcoming album "Sound Oracle". This single is also produced by Wichti. Stay tuned by subscribing for more videos by Acidtrip directed by Sheeraz Balushi.

Listen to Acidtrip "Sound Oracle" on Spotify:
https://open.spotify.com/album/3QhFDnedwplGCAJEjRCUZA?si=Vu-inyVgSb26E7rOCRIX_g&dl_branch=1


Listen to Acidtrip "Sound Oracle" on Apple:
https://music.apple.com/us/album/sound-oracle/1529752602



